{{About|the Blazes at the spawn of the [[Crimson Isle]]|other blazes|Blaze (disambiguation)}}
The three '''Blazes''' are a group of [[Mobs]] found past the spawn of {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} and in the {{Zone|Stronghold}}, several blocks away from {{NPCSprite|Elle}}. When killed, they never spawn again, and her quest begins.

== Spawning ==
The three '''Blazes''' can be found just past the spawn of the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}, in the {{Zone|Stronghold}}'s entrance next to the right of {{NPCSprite|Elle}}.

== Behavior ==
The three '''Blazes''' stay still and occasionally shoot fireballs towards the player and {{NPCSprite|Elle}}. Once killed, they will never respawn again, and the player can speak to {{NPCSprite|Elle}} to continue her quest, leading to the [[Crimson Isle Main Questline]].

